k": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "33057666", "author": {"steamid": "76561198079020543", "personaname": "LeBowski", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198079020543/", "num_games_owned": 272, "num_reviews": 14, "playtime_forever": 1310, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 972, "last_played": 1592162327, "avatar": "649edd87db6038aac9cd328850818d8106b9766a"}, "language": "english", "review": "<3_<3\n\nPros\n+Pixel graphics on point\n+Variety in characters\n+Items with special effects? ♥♥♥♥ yes!\n+Easy to beat, yet hard to complete\n+Variety in monsters\n+Multiplayer is awesome!\n+Platform parkour to get secret Artifacts!\n+Complete a challenge and get rewarded with a new unlocked Item or Character!\n+Secrets!\n+Simply a hell of a lot of fun\n+Have had runs that lasted over 2 hours\n+Every run is fun, never repetitive\n+Amazing controller support <3\n+Great music!\n+Difficulty increases over time\n+I didn't rage once\n+I basically got to the point where I was immortal (Loader class OP)\n\nCons\n-Beatable within an hour if you're skilled (though not completed!)\n-Singleplayer is too difficult4me\n-No pausing in multiplayer (can be done when the teleporter is done, though it isn't a literal pause and the difficulty will keep increasing...)\n-Wiki is a must if you want to complete the game\n-Don't like 2D platformers? Don't buy it\n-Can take multiple hours per run\n-You can't save an MP run\n-I played singleplayer 3 times and died within 15 mins (I'm bad at SP)", "timestamp_created": 1498860253, "timestamp_updated": 1498860253, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "33055966", "author": {